t-color has-link-color wp-elements-8\">Need a Maintenance Plan?</h2>\n\n<p class=\"has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-9 wp-block-paragraph\">What You Receive With the Carolina Comfort Club:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"has-primary-inverse-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-block-list wp-elements-10\">\n<li>15% Off Repair</li>\n\n<li>Heating &amp; Cooling Tune-Up</li>\n\n<li>Reduced Dispatch Fees</li>\n\n<li>Priority Service</li>\n\n<li>Save More with Loyalty Points</li>\n</ul>\n\n<a href=\"/maintenance\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"outline\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta full-width-mobile\">\n    <span >Learn More</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div  class=\"splitter-column splitter-column--right splitter-column--start has-background has-primary-inverse-background-color\">\n    <div class=\"splitter-column-inner splitter-column-inner--contained splitter-column-inner--padded\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group flow has-global-padding is-layout-constrained wp-block-group-is-layout-constrained\"><div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1802\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/03/A-Carolina-Heating-Service-employee-smiling-while-sitting-at-a-desk-and-working-on-their-computer.jpg\" alt=\"A Carolina Heating Service employee smiling while sitting at a desk and working on their computer\" class=\"wp-image-4837\" style=\"border-radius:0px\" /></figure>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading mt-3\">Ask Us About Financing!</h2>\n\n<p class=\"mb-3 wp-block-paragraph\">Financing plans bring value and benefits to homeowners. By opting for a financing option, you can tackle necessary repairs or upgrades without draining your savings or delaying important projects. Here are some key advantages:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"my-0 mb-0 wp-block-list\">\n<li>Budget-Friendly</li>\n\n<li>Access to Quality Services</li>\n\n<li>Timely Repairs</li>\n\n<li>Flexibility</li>\n\n<li>Increase Home Value</li>\n\n<li>Emergency Protection</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p class=\"mt-3 wp-block-paragraph\">Keep your home safe and comfortable with a finance plan. Always assess terms and interest rates to find the best one for your needs. A professional can help you make an informed decision.</p>\n\n<a href=\"/financing\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta full-width-mobile\">\n    <span >Learn More</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<div id=\"our-certifications\" class=\"container certifications-and-awards py-5\">\n    <h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center mb-4 d-inline-block h-decorator h-decorator--primary\">Our Certifications &amp; Awards</h2>\n<div  class=\"logocarousel\" style=\"--count: 5;\" data-logo-count=\"5\">\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"button-reset | logocarousel-arrow logocarousel-arrow--start\" aria-label=\"See previous\"><svg class=\"logocarousel-arrow-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg></button>\n    <div class=\"logocarousel--inner-container\">\n        <ul role=\"list\" class=\"logocarousel-list\" style=\"--logo-count:5;\">\n                                <li class=\"logocarousel-item\">\n                        <div class=\"logocarousel-wrap\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"113\" src=\"/images/2024/03/Better-Business-Bureau-Accredited-Business.png\" class=\"logocarousel-image\" alt=\"Better Busines