5.6,12.1,102.9,9.7,99.4,9.7L99.4,9.7z M99.6,13.1c1.6,0,2.8,0.9,3.2,1.9l-7.9,3.3 C94.6,15.7,97,13.1,99.6,13.1L99.6,13.1z\"/><path fill=\"#3CBA54\" d=\"M85.6,26.8h3.9V0.9h-3.9V26.8z\"/></svg>\n            <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__logo__text\">\n                Reviews <span class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__logo__text__stars\">★★★★★</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating\"><div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__stars\">\n                <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__stars__black\">★★★★★</div>\n                <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__stars__white\">☆☆☆☆☆</div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__score\">\n                5/5\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__head__rating__number-of-reviews\">\n                <span>18 Reviews</span>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n        <!-- reviews body -->\n    <div class=\"google-reviews-featured__body\">\n                                                <!-- review carousel -->\n                <div class=\"nearu-carousel multi-component-container multi-component-container--uniform-height\">                    <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Stephanie Buccolo\" aria-label=\"Stephanie Buccolo\">Stephanie Buccolo</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>Furnace stopped working unexpectedly two days before the holiday weekend and Carolina had a tech out right away. Had to order a new blower motor but expedited it and got it installed next day! Excellent communication and a big thanks to the tech who fit me into his already busy schedule.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n                            <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Sigrid McMahon\" aria-label=\"Sigrid McMahon\">Sigrid McMahon</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>Carolina Heating came out the very next day to attend to our problem and were thorough in solving it. Previously we called them for a tankless hot water heater that just stopped working. They came out that day, fixed the problem and did a complete maintenance of the system and took the time to explain how a tankless water heater works. We will definitely continue to use them. They respond quickly, their technicians are knowledgeable, courteous and prompt and they are reasonably priced.</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n                            <div  class=\"card card--google-review has-white-background-color has-black-color\">\n        <div class=\"card__content\">\n                    <p class=\"card__content__title card__title h3\" title=\"Robert Elliott\" aria-label=\"Robert Elliott\">Robert Elliott</p>\n            <div class=\"card__content__title__stars\">★★★★★</div>\n                    <div class=\"card__content__description card__description\">\n<p>The technician fixed the problem in no time and gave me a reasonable estimate for the full repairs. We have heat again and me and my pregnant wife couldn&#8217;t be happier! Definitely will stick with this service!</p>\n</div>\n\n                </div></div>\n            </div>\n    <!-- ./ review carousel -->\n    <div class=\"nearu-carousel-controls\">\n\t<div class=\"nearu-carousel-button button-prev\">    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronleft\" /></svg>    </div>\n    </div>\n\t<div class=\"carousel-dots\"><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 1 of 3\" data-nearu-carousel-dot-index=\"1\" class=\"carousel-dots__dot selected\"></div><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 2 of 3\" data-nearu-carousel-dot-index=\"2\" class=\"carousel-dots__dot\"></div><div role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Go to slide 3 of 3\" data-nearu-carousel-dot-index=\"3\" class=\"carousel-dots__dot\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"nearu-carousel-button button-next\">    <div class=\"iconblock\" data-size=\"lg\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"block\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>    </div>\n    </div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- ./ reviews body -->\n\n</div></div>\n\t</div>\n\t</article><!-- #post-6243 -->"
